# Phase 7: Project Demonstration Phase

## Project Title: EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

### 1. Introduction

The Project Demonstration Phase focuses on presenting the completed EduGenie application to the project evaluator, faculty members, and users. This phase demonstrates the working features, user interface, AI integration, and overall functionality of the system.

EduGenie is a web-based AI-powered educational platform that uses Google Gemini API to help students understand academic topics, generate notes, summarize study materials, and prepare for examinations.

### 2. Objectives of Demonstration

1. To demonstrate the working of the EduGenie application.

2. To showcase the AI chatbot functionality.

3. To demonstrate automatic notes generation.

4. To show the text summarization feature.

5. To demonstrate exam preparation tools.

6. To explain the integration of Google Gemini API.

7. To collect feedback from evaluators and users.

