EduGenie is an AI-based educational platform designed to support students in their learning activities.

It provides an AI chatbot, notes generation, text summarization, and examination preparation features.

We have developed the frontend using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, the backend using Python Flask, and integrated Google Gemini API for AI-powered responses.

Now, we will demonstrate the working of our application."

